### Feature Appointment — DELETE físico / DELETE lógico (state = cancelled)
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1

# @name deleteAppointmentPhysical
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/citas/{{id}}

###

# @name deleteAppointmentLogical
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/citas/{{id}}/deactivate
